@title Pelican
# A delicate 3D American white pelican standing on a wooden post, written by generate.py.
# Every part is a parametric surface. Most are lofts: an ellipse swept along a curved spine
# whose shape and sizes are cubic splines; each spline segment is its own surface, so the
# segments share their edges exactly. The bird faces +x before the whole model is turned
# 45 degrees about z. No colour is pure black or pure white, so light and dark mode
# show the same colours (Arch only changes the 3D background).
//Body, neck and head
